                <mxCell id="fgp" value="fact_gene_pair  [new — SCORECARD HEADER]&#xa;═══════════════════&#xa;PK gene_pair_id&#xa;FK version_id → data_load_version&#xa;FK run_id → etl_pipeline_run&#xa;FK config_id → relatedness_config&#xa;FK gene_a_id → gene · FK gene_b_id → gene&#xa;organism  (never crosses)&#xa;───── ① co-essentiality ─────&#xa;coess_effect(|ρ|) · coess_rho · coess_support · coess_p · coess_fdr · coess_tier&#xa;───── ② co-hit ─────&#xa;cohit_effect_jaccard · cohit_effect_pmi · cohit_support · cohit_fisher_p · cohit_fdr · cohit_tier&#xa;───── ③ co-citation ─────&#xa;cocite_effect_pmi · cocite_support · cocite_p · cocite_fdr · cocite_tier&#xa;───── ④ contextual ─────&#xa;context_effect · context_support · context_best_key · context_best_fdr · context_tier&#xa;───── ⑤ novelty / mechanistic-divergence (ADDITIVE) ─────&#xa;resid_rho · resid_effect · resid_support · resid_p · resid_fdr · resid_tier&#xa;novelty_score · is_antagonistic&#xa;is_buffering_candidate · buffering_basis  (hypothesis — testable by combinatorial KO)&#xa;───── overall ─────&#xa;relatedness_tier · evidence_channels · total_support · min_fdr · is_current&#xa;CHECK(gene_a_id &lt; gene_b_id)&#xa;UNIQUE(version_id, config_id, gene_a_id, gene_b_id)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5ff;strokeColor=#9673a6;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
